  data: {
    LLM: "1. Drawing and discarding proceed counter-clockwise.\n2. In K'ap Tái Shap, any player can shout 'K'ap!' to take a discard out of turn IF it completes their winning hand (similar to Mahjong).",
    Player: "1. Drawing and discarding proceed counter-clockwise.\n2. In K'ap Tái Shap, any player can shout 'K'ap!' to take a discard out of turn IF it completes their winning hand (similar to Mahjong).",
